# ============================================================
# RETRIEVED ORG SOURCE — NOT COMMITTED
# This repo is PUBLIC. Metadata retrieved from a real org (component
# names, Apex logic, business rules) is the org owner's to publish, not
# a default. Generated OUTPUT is ignored for the same reason: it is a
# translation of that source.
#
# The three fixture bundles this project ships with are re-included
# below, because the tests depend on them.
# ============================================================
force-app/main/default/lwc/*
force-app/main/default/classes/*
!force-app/main/default/lwc/accountList/
!force-app/main/default/lwc/brokerCard/
!force-app/main/default/lwc/propertySummary/
react/generated/*
# react/fixtures is OUR output from OUR fixtures — committed, tests depend on it
springboot/generated/*
knowledge/graph.json
census/census.json

